The runtime returns wait-tree vertices to clients and calls their parent
vertices through this interface.  The hierarchy therefore crosses DSO/LTO
boundaries: hidden visibility permits incorrect whole-program devirtualization
of a client's wait_context_vertex as a runtime thread_reference_vertex.
Use the existing export attribute to keep this shared interface public.

